{"seq":4,"slug":"major-works","title":"稻盛和夫·代表成就","stage":"DONE","category":"kazuo-inamori","categoryLabel":"稻盛和夫","chapterCount":3,"docCount":6,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/kazuo-inamori/major-works","rating":{"composite":3.63,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3,"positioning":4,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"hubDir":"/Users/wangyang.learnwy/learnwy/learnwy/l-doc-hub/hubs/famous-people/10_kazuo-inamori/4_major-works","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"主要著作\">主要著作</h1><p>本卷聚焦稻盛和夫的「代表作品」——既包括他写在纸上的著作，也包括他用一生缔造的企业。核心命题是：稻盛的「作品」有两种形态，<strong>著述</strong>（《活法》《干法》《阿米巴经营》《实学》）传播他的「言」，<strong>企业</strong>（京瓷、日本航空）呈现他的「行」，二者互为印证，缺一不可。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本卷-vs-兄弟卷-分工边界\">本卷 vs 兄弟卷：分工边界</h2><p>稻盛人物 hub 共六卷，容易与本卷混淆的是第 2、3 卷，请按下表对号入座：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>卷</th>\n<th>回答的问题</th>\n<th>与本卷的边界</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1 生平与时代</td>\n<td>稻盛一生「发生了什么」</td>\n<td>提供史实，本卷只在需要时引用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2 核心贡献</td>\n<td>稻盛「贡献了什么」（阿米巴、三大企业的机制）</td>\n<td>讲「机制本身」；本卷讲「承载机制的著作与企业作为作品」</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3 思想与方法</td>\n<td>稻盛「主张什么」（人生方程式、敬天爱人、六项精进）</td>\n<td>讲「思想本身」；本卷讲「思想被写进哪本书」</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>4 主要著作（本卷）</strong></td>\n<td><strong>稻盛的「作品」是什么、各自定位与传播</strong></td>\n<td>以「作品」为单位组织</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5 影响与遗产</td>\n<td>稻盛「影响了谁」</td>\n<td>讲扩散与后世，本卷讲源头文本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>6 争议与评价</td>\n<td>稻盛「被如何评判」</td>\n<td>提供批判视角，本卷各篇引用其平衡争议</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>简言之：<strong>想了解一个思想 → 去第 3 卷；想了解一项机制 → 去第 2 卷；想了解某部作品（书或企业）的定位与背景 → 留在本卷。</strong> 本卷各篇刻意不重复展开机制与思想细节，只用相对链接指向兄弟卷的主篇。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本卷结构与推荐学习路径\">本卷结构与推荐学习路径</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    subgraph 言[&quot;著述(言)&quot;]&#10;        L1[&quot;《活法》&lt;br/&gt;人生观&quot;]&#10;        L2[&quot;《活法》核心讯息&quot;]&#10;        W1[&quot;阿米巴 &amp; 会计著作&lt;br/&gt;方法论&quot;]&#10;        W2[&quot;《干法》&lt;br/&gt;工作观&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 行[&quot;企业(行)&quot;]&#10;        E1[&quot;京瓷:从零创造的杰作&quot;]&#10;        E2[&quot;日航:起死回生的明证&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    L1 --&gt; L2 --&gt; W2 --&gt; W1 --&gt; E1 --&gt; E2\">flowchart TD\n    subgraph 言[\"著述(言)\"]\n        L1[\"《活法》&lt;br/&gt;人生观\"]\n        L2[\"《活法》核心讯息\"]\n        W1[\"阿米巴 &amp; 会计著作&lt;br/&gt;方法论\"]\n        W2[\"《干法》&lt;br/&gt;工作观\"]\n    end\n    subgraph 行[\"企业(行)\"]\n        E1[\"京瓷:从零创造的杰作\"]\n        E2[\"日航:起死回生的明证\"]\n    end\n    L1 --&gt; L2 --&gt; W2 --&gt; W1 --&gt; E1 --&gt; E2</pre><ul>\n<li><strong>第一章 活法之道</strong>：<a href=\"living-the-way/the-book-living\">《活法》这本书</a>（定位与传播）+ <a href=\"living-the-way/core-messages-of-living\">核心讯息</a>（思想逐条拆解）。</li>\n<li><strong>第二章 论经营与工作</strong>：<a href=\"on-management-and-work/how-to-work-and-passion\">《干法》与工作哲学</a>（工作观）+ <a href=\"on-management-and-work/amoeba-and-accounting-books\">阿米巴经营与会计著作</a>（方法论工具）。</li>\n<li><strong>第三章 作为作品的企业</strong>：<a href=\"enterprises-as-works/kyocera-as-masterpiece\">京瓷：作为杰作的企业</a>（从零创造）+ <a href=\"enterprises-as-works/jal-revival-as-proof\">日航重建：哲学的明证</a>（起死回生）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>前置知识</strong>：本卷不要求预读，但若先浏览<a href=\"../ideas-and-methods/the-life-equation/thinking-passion-ability\">人生方程式</a>与<a href=\"../ideas-and-methods/respect-heaven-love-people/altruism-as-principle\">敬天爱人</a>，再读本卷会更省力——因为所有著作本质上都是这两个思想内核的不同投影。</p>\n<p><strong>推荐路径</strong>：修身者读「言」即可（活法 → 干法）；经营者建议「先言后行」——先用活法/干法建立价值观，再用阿米巴/实学落地工具，最后以京瓷、日航两个案例校验。切忌跳过哲学直接搬工具，这是稻盛本人反复警告的头号反模式。</p>\n<h2 id=\"跨卷延伸\">跨卷延伸</h2><p>读完本卷，可顺以下线索深入：著作的后世扩散见<a href=\"../influence-and-legacy/enduring-legacy/philosophy-of-life-and-work\">影响与遗产</a>；对这套哲学「是智慧还是同义反复」的批评见<a href=\"../controversies-and-appraisal/overall-appraisal/a-balanced-assessment\">争议与评价</a>；著作思想的组织源头（盛和塾）见<a href=\"../core-contributions/management-philosophy/seiwajuku-and-passing-on\">盛和塾与传承</a>。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"living-the-way","title":"《活法》","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/kazuo-inamori/major-works/living-the-way","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-book-living","title":"《活法》：一本人生哲学之书","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/kazuo-inamori/major-works/living-the-way/the-book-living"},{"seq":2,"slug":"core-messages-of-living","title":"《活法》的核心讯息","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/kazuo-inamori/major-works/living-the-way/core-messages-of-living"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"on-management-and-work","title":"经营与工作著作","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/kazuo-inamori/major-works/on-management-and-work","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"amoeba-and-accounting-books","title":"阿米巴经营与会计著作","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/kazuo-inamori/major-works/on-management-and-work/amoeba-and-accounting-books"},{"seq":2,"slug":"how-to-work-and-passion","title":"《干法》与工作哲学","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/kazuo-inamori/major-works/on-management-and-work/how-to-work-and-passion"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"enterprises-as-works","title":"作为作品的企业","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/kazuo-inamori/major-works/enterprises-as-works","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"kyocera-as-masterpiece","title":"京瓷：作为杰作的企业","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/kazuo-inamori/major-works/enterprises-as-works/kyocera-as-masterpiece"},{"seq":2,"slug":"jal-revival-as-proof","title":"日航重建：哲学的明证","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/kazuo-inamori/major-works/enterprises-as-works/jal-revival-as-proof"}]}]}